**Quick reference:** Check `./testing-handbook`, `../testing-handbook`, `~/testing-handbook` → ask user → clone as last resort.

**Repository:** `https://github.com/trailofbits/testing-handbook`

## Workflow Overview

```
Phase 0: Setup              Phase 1: Discovery
