name: openhands
description: Delegate coding to OpenHands CLI (model-agnostic, LiteLLM).
version: 0.1.0
author: Tim Koepsel (xzessmedia), Hermes Agent
license: MIT
platforms: [linux, macos]
metadata:
  hermes:
    tags: [Coding-Agent, OpenHands, Model-Agnostic, LiteLLM]
